## Interface: 16001
## Title: Ryna Fights
## Notes: Your recent fights in Ryna's window: who struck first, who died when, damage done and taken over each fight, whom each enemy was attacking, from your combat log as the Ryna app reads it. And, live from the game, a meter (damage, healing and more) and a threat bar while your group is fighting. A mod of Ryna; /ryna fights.
## Author: Ryna contributors
## Version: 0.4.2
## Dependencies: Ryna
## LoadOnDemand: 0

